<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19822" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βερενίκη</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ], ἡ</span>, Macedon. form for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Φερενίκη</span>, freq. pr. n. in the time of the
		Ptolemies:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βερνίκη</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>Act.Ap.</u>
			25.13
		</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βερενίκης</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλόκαμος</span>, a <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>constellation</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gem.
				3.8
			</span></i>, etc.; also, a <i>throw of the dice</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>:— hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βερενίκιον</span></b> , τό, a
			<i>plant</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; also, <i>nitre</i> of the best quality, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.568
			</span></i>:—
				Dim.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βερενικάριον</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βερνικάριον</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νίτρον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				107
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				6.54
			</span></i>:—<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βερενικίδες</span></b> , αἱ, women's
			<i>shoes</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
